# Whitelist: ignore everything, then include only this project's own source and notes.
# The game archive (*.obb), the decompilation (saga-main/), the cloned guides and anything
# extracted from the game (work/) can therefore never be committed by accident.
*

!.gitignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!MODLOG.md
!STATUS.md
!lego-star-wars-formats.md

!docs/
!docs/**/*.md

!crates/
!crates/*/
!crates/*/Cargo.toml
!crates/*/src/
!crates/*/src/**/
!crates/*/src/**/*.rs
!crates/*/src/**/*.wgsl
